    "rationale": "The incident demonstrates a deliberate brute-force attack originating partly from confirmed malicious infrastructure (198.51.100.77, known for scanning and brute-force activity) alongside concurrent endpoint probing (84 404s on /profile). Critically, 3 login attempts succeeded out of 17 total attempts across multiple targeted accounts within a tight 10.6-second window. Because valid logins occurred in the middle of active credential guessing from malicious and untrusted IPs, immediate on-call investigation is required to verify whether legitimate accounts have been compromised.",
